    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d544">

                <pb facs="0544" n="460" sameAs="frus:frus1918Supp02/pg460"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 855.48/672a</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        British Ambassador</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Spring Rice</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-10-08">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">October 8, 1917</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">My Dear Mr. Ambassador</hi>: The Secretary of the
                    Treasury has transmitted to me a copy of instructions which have been sent to
                    the Collector of Customs, relative to examinations of vessels departing from
                    this country laden with Belgian Relief cargoes, and I am forwarding herewith a
                    copy of the instructions in question.<anchor n="1" xml:id="d544-f1"/>
                </p>
                <p>It is understood that in consideration of this examination undertaken by the
                    Treasury Department, which was the result of an informal arrangement between the
                    Embassy and officials of that Department, no further examinations of supplies
                    for Belgian Relief work will be made at Halifax. I should be pleased to receive
                    from you a confirmation of the arrangement proposed.</p>
                <p>I am [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Robert Lansing</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
